cor.<\/p><a href=\"\/cafe-acoustic-panels-bali\/\">See caf\u00e9 acoustics \u2192<\/a><\/div><div><b>Villa & bedroom<\/b><i>Wide fabric \u00b7 Timber slat \u00b7 Printed art<\/i><p>A softer, quieter room that keeps the villa style.<\/p><a href=\"\/villa-acoustic-panels-bali\/\">See villa acoustics \u2192<\/a><\/div><div><b>Podcast & content<\/b><i>Hexagons \u00b7 Fabric panel<\/i><p>Clear voice on the mic and a backdrop that looks good on camera.<\/p><a href=\"\/podcast-room-acoustic-panels-bali\/\">See podcast rooms \u2192<\/a><\/div><div><b>Studio & home cinema<\/b><i>Fabric panel 12 cm \u00b7 Timber slat<\/i><p>Accurate sound at the listening seat, with bass traps in the corners.<\/p><a href=\"\/music-studio-bali\/\">See music studios \u2192<\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section><section class=\"alt\"><div class=\"in\"><div class=\"eb\">Step 2 \u00b7 Choose a model<\/div><h2>Six models, made to measure<\/h2><p class=\"note\" style=\"margin:-6px 0 18px\">NRC shows how much sound a panel absorbs: 0 = none, 1.00 = almost all.<\/p><div class=\"pfg\"><div class=\"pfc\"><img src=\"https:\/\/pratamabuild.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/pbc-akustik-m-kain.jpg\" alt=\"Fabric Panel \u2013 acoustic wall panel by PBC Bali\" width=\"1531\" height=\"895\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><h3>Fabric Panel<\/h3><p>The workhorse of acoustic treatment. A deep 12 cm panel that absorbs speech and music evenly, placed at the first-reflection points.<\/p><table><tr><td>Size<\/td><td>60 \u00d7 120 cm<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Depth<\/td><td>12 cm<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Absorption<\/td><td>NRC 1.00<\/td><\/tr><\/table><details><summary>Full specification<\/summary><dl><dt>Core<\/dt><dd>100 mm rockwool board, 60 kg\/m\u00b3<\/dd><dt>Face<\/dt><dd>Breathable acoustic fabric<\/dd><dt>Mounting<\/dt><dd>Centre at ear height, hidden Z-clips<\/dd><dt>Colours<\/dt><dd>12 colour palettes or your own colour<\/dd><dt>Best for<\/dt><dd>Music studio, band room, home cinema, recording room<\/dd><\/dl><\/details><a class=\"pfl\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/6285745026574?text=Hello%20PBC%2C%20I%27d%20like%20advice%20on%20acoustic%20wall%20panels%20%28Fabric%20Panel%29.\">Ask about this model \u2192<\/a><\/div><div class=\"pfc\"><img src=\"https:\/\/pratamabuild.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/pbc-akustik-m-wide.jpg\" alt=\"Wide Fabric Panel \u2013 acoustic wall panel by PBC Bali\" width=\"1531\" height=\"895\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><h3>Wide Fabric Panel<\/h3><p>A slim landscape panel that calms echo in everyday rooms without looking technical.<\/p><table><tr><td>Size<\/td><td>120 \u00d7 60 cm<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Depth<\/td><td>7 cm<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Absorption<\/td><td>NRC 0.90<\/td><\/tr><\/table><details><summary>Full specification<\/summary><dl><dt>Core<\/dt><dd>50 mm rockwool \/ glasswool, 60\u201380 kg\/m\u00b3<\/dd><dt>Face<\/dt><dd>Acoustic fabric or PET felt<\/dd><dt>Mounting<\/dt><dd>Centre at ear height, hidden Z-clips<\/dd><dt>Colours<\/dt><dd>12 colour palettes or your own colour<\/dd><dt>Best for<\/dt><dd>Meeting room, caf\u00e9, bedroom, villa<\/dd><\/dl><\/details><a class=\"pfl\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/6285745026574?text=Hello%20PBC%2C%20I%27d%20like%20advice%20on%20acoustic%20wall%20panels%20%28Wide%20Fabric%20Panel%29.\">Ask about this model \u2192<\/a><\/div><div class=\"pfc\"><img src=\"https:\/\/pratamabuild.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/pbc-akustik-m-hex.jpg\" alt=\"Honeycomb Hexagons \u2013 acoustic wall panel by PBC Bali\" width=\"1531\" height=\"895\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><h3>Honeycomb Hexagons<\/h3><p>Seven hexagons in two or three tones \u2014 a camera-friendly backdrop that also tames echo.<\/p><table><tr><td>Size<\/td><td>Set 90 \u00d7 80 cm<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Depth<\/td><td>5 cm<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Absorption<\/td><td>NRC 0.90<\/td><\/tr><\/table><details><summary>Full specification<\/summary><dl><dt>Core<\/dt><dd>50 mm rockwool \/ glasswool, 60\u201380 kg\/m\u00b3<\/dd><dt>Face<\/dt><dd>Acoustic fabric or PET felt<\/dd><dt>Mounting<\/dt><dd>Centre at ear height, hidden Z-clips<\/dd><dt>Colours<\/dt><dd>12 colour palettes or your own colour<\/dd><dt>Best for<\/dt><dd>Podcast, content room, bedroom, caf\u00e9<\/dd><\/dl><\/details><a class=\"pfl\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/6285745026574?text=Hello%20PBC%2C%20I%27d%20like%20advice%20on%20acoustic%20wall%20panels%20%28Honeycomb%20Hexagons%29.\">Ask about this model \u2192<\/a><\/div><div class=\"pfc\"><img src=\"https:\/\/pratamabuild.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/pbc-akustik-m-round.jpg\" alt=\"Round Panels \u2013 acoustic wall panel by PBC Bali\" width=\"1531\" height=\"895\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><h3>Round Panels<\/h3><p>Overlapping circles in soft tones for a relaxed, modern wall.<\/p><table><tr><td>Size<\/td><td>\u00d8 90 cm + smaller circle<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Depth<\/td><td>5 cm<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Absorption<\/td><td>NRC 0.90<\/td><\/tr><\/table><details><summary>Full specification<\/summary><dl><dt>Core<\/dt><dd>50 mm rockwool \/ glasswool, 60\u201380 kg\/m\u00b3<\/dd><dt>Face<\/dt><dd>Acoustic fabric or PET felt<\/dd><dt>Mounting<\/dt><dd>Centre at ear height, hidden Z-clips<\/dd><dt>Colours<\/dt><dd>12 colour palettes or your own colour<\/dd><dt>Best for<\/dt><dd>Caf\u00e9, meeting room, content room<\/dd><\/dl><\/details><a class=\"pfl\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/6285745026574?text=Hello%20PBC%2C%20I%27d%20like%20advice%20on%20acoustic%20wall%20panels%20%28Round%20Panels%29.\">Ask about this model \u2192<\/a><\/div><div class=\"pfc\"><img src=\"https:\/\/pratamabuild.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/pbc-akustik-m-slat.jpg\" alt=\"Timber Slat Panel \u2013 acoustic wall panel by PBC Bali\" width=\"1531\" height=\"895\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><h3>Timber Slat Panel<\/h3><p>Warm timber slats over black felt and rockwool. Absorbs sound while the room stays lively and natural.<\/p><table><tr><td>Size<\/td><td>60 cm \u00d7 floor to ceiling<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Depth<\/td><td>12 cm<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Absorption<\/td><td>NRC 0.75<\/td><\/tr><\/table><details><summary>Full specification<\/summary><dl><dt>Core<\/dt><dd>Black felt + 50 mm rockwool + 50 mm air gap<\/dd><dt>Face<\/dt><dd>Timber or veneered MDF slats<\/dd><dt>Mounting<\/dt><dd>Screwed to battens, floor to ceiling<\/dd><dt>Colours<\/dt><dd>12 colour palettes or your own colour<\/dd><dt>Best for<\/dt><dd>Villa, bedroom, meeting room, home cinema, recording room<\/dd><\/dl><\/details><a class=\"pfl\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/6285745026574?text=Hello%20PBC%2C%20I%27d%20like%20advice%20on%20acoustic%20wall%20panels%20%28Timber%20Slat%20Panel%29.\">Ask about this model \u2192<\/a><\/div><div class=\"pfc\"><img src=\"https:\/\/pratamabuild.id\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/pbc-akustik-m-printed.jpg\" alt=\"Printed Art Panel \u2013 acoustic wall panel by PBC Bali\" width=\"1531\" height=\"895\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><h3>Printed Art Panel<\/h3><p>Any artwork, logo or photo printed on acoustic fabric. Looks like a canvas, works like an acoustic panel.<\/p><table><tr><td>Size<\/td><td>120 \u00d7 80 cm<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Depth<\/td><td>5 cm<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Absorption<\/td><td>NRC 0.90<\/td><\/tr><\/table><details><summary>Full specification<\/summary><dl><dt>Core<\/dt><dd>50 mm rockwool \/ glasswool, 60\u201380 kg\/m\u00b3<\/dd><dt>Face<\/dt><dd>Printed acoustic fabric<\/dd><dt>Mounting<\/dt><dd>Centre at ear height, hidden Z-clips<\/dd><dt>Colours<\/dt><dd>12 colour palettes or your own colour<\/dd><dt>Best for<\/dt><dd>Caf\u00e9, restaurant, meeting room, bedroom<\/dd><\/dl><\/details><a class=\"pfl\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/6285745026574?text=Hello%20PBC%2C%20I%27d%20like%20advice%20on%20acoustic%20wall%20panels%20%28Printed%20Art%20Panel%29.\">Ask about this model \u2192<\/a><\/div><\/div><p class=\"note\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">Sizes shown are standard. Every panel can be made to your size.<\/p><div class=\"ask\"><b>Looking for another shape?<\/b><p>We also make curved, fluted, per